<title>AUSTRALIA: Delta appoints Lindsay MacAlister to board.</title>
<headline>Delta appoints Lindsay MacAlister to board.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold and platinum miner Delta Gold Ltd said on Wednesday it has appointed Orogen Minerals Ltd deputy chairman Lindsay MacAlister as a non-executive director.</p>
<p>MacAlister, who is also chairman of Golden Cross Resources NL, is a former managing director of the Australian Trade Commission and a former executive chairman of Pancontinential Mining Ltd.</p>
<p>Delta said MacAlister would bring a great depth of technical, commercial and corporate experience to its board.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
